Description:
    Generates an app/services/{service_namespace}/types.rb file with an empty
    Types module that extends Support::Typespace.

    If the file already exists, the generator exits early without overwriting it.

Arguments:
    NAME    The PascalCase owner model name (e.g. StarLevel)

Example:
    bin/rails generate vog:typespace StarLevel

    This will create:
        app/services/star_levels/types.rb
